+
+title: Every registered repo's coder binding names its tools in the adapter's own names
+category: chore
+
+Premise: seven registered repos carry a .satelle/workflows/agents.local.toml
+whose [coder] tools restate another adapter's names. The cross-repo fence
+refuses this session's edit to those files, so the fix is applied by the
+operator instead.
+
+Acceptance criteria:
+1. The agent prints the operator a shell command, a sed loop over the seven
+   repos, that rewrites the [coder] tools line in each repo's
+   agents.local.toml outside satelle.
+2. After the operator runs it, `satelle validate` passes in each repo.
